            "review_title": "Review at The Rabbit Hole Irish Sports Bar",
            "review_text": "davros b\nPerth, Australia\n7 contributions\n0\nBest Bar in D2 hands down!!!\nJan 2025 • Family\nGREAT spot - roof top terrace with a beautiful view over the river & city. Incredible live sports selection. Brilliant live music and movie nights. Cracking beer & booze selection.\n\nInsanely good food - give it 2 years and they'll be talking about that Legend Burger in New York. Fact.\nInsider tip:\nThe Legend Burger. Treat yourself!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 15, 2025\nRabbit Hole Irish Sports Bar Saigon\nCheers Davros,\nThat’s some review — appreciate it. Glad you enjoyed the rooftop, the sport, and the music. We have since moved to Thao Dien Hopefully see you back in D2 again soon for a few more.\nRead more\nWritten May 5, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
